{
    // FROM: VAL
    "Val.Mail.3HGift": "Hail and well-met, @!^^A friend named Billie owns a brewery back in the Fern Islands. Best booze that side of the Salish Sea. Here's the recipe for their special Bourbon.^^It's a well-kept secret. Or, was, until I told you.^^Sincerely,^Val%item cookingRecipe DN.SnS_salishbourbon%%[#]Salish Bourbon Recipe",
    "Val.Mail.6HGift": "Hail and well-met, @!^^Here's one of my favorite treats from Josa; sure am glad Rosa stocks them!^^Thanks again for wrapping me up after I got hurt. Not sure what I would have done without you...^^Sincerely,^Val%item id DN.SnS_ChocolateOrange 1%%[#]Chocolate Orange",
    "Val.Mail.9HGift": "Hail and well-met, @!^^I hopped the train to Zuzu to get some supplies and saw this in a bin at the market... Everyone deserves a cute Pepper Rex, most of all you.^^So I brought it back on the train with me. Enjoy!^^Sincerely,^Val%item id DN.SnS_PepperRexPillow 1%%[#]Pepper Rex Pillow",
    "Val.Mail.10HGift": "My guiding firelight,^^You looked outright heroic standing between me and that Stygium Crab. Thank you for the rescue; here's a little gift.^^Wear this when you think of me, alright?^^Sincerely,^Yours.%item id DN.SnS_ValHoodie%%[#]Val's Hoodie",
    // FROM: CORIANDER
    "Coriander.Mail.2HGift": "Heya, @!^^Here's a copy of that cookbook I mentioned. I earmarked the good bits for you!^^I spent a lot of time in ZuZu City, so the local foods were very near and dear to my heart. I tried my best to recreate them!^^XOXOXO,^Cori%item id DN.SnS_InTheKitchenWithCirrus 1%%[#]In the Kitchen with Cirrus",
}